Package: opencode-box
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), docker.io | docker-ce
Maintainer: Your Name <you@example.com>
Description: Manage an opencode box docker container
 opencode-box installs, starts, stops and removes a docker container
 named "opencode" that mounts ~/opencode-work as /work, and lets you
 open a shell inside it either as your own user or as root.
